00:28:29.920 --> 00:28:30.920
Those paths can go anywhere.

00:28:31.080 --> 00:28:33.080
And that also kind of guarantees me something.

00:28:33.400 --> 00:28:40.040
Yeah. And also at this point, I mean, it might be kind of silly to say, but at this point, you don't know that walking to the edge of the screen will move you to another screen.

00:28:40.120 --> 00:28:41.240
You don't know. You're like, this is all.

00:28:41.380 --> 00:28:44.240
