00:29:16.420 --> 00:29:19.480
Okay. In terms of just like obfuscation.

00:29:20.400 --> 00:29:27.020
But I think by and large, like the overworld map is a pretty intuitive map.

00:29:27.320 --> 00:29:33.260
Joe, any points in the game where you felt like the game was pushing you in a certain direction that Sean didn't mention?

00:29:34.720 --> 00:29:35.700
