00:31:39.260 --> 00:31:40.740
Okay. Joe, did you have anything?

00:31:40.880 --> 00:31:45.560
Yeah, I think so. I just want it to be a little more obvious than the others.

00:31:45.720 --> 00:31:48.780
But a lot of times in the, I think it only happens in the dungeons.

00:31:48.980 --> 00:31:54.840
When you clear a room of enemies, it'll give you like one bomb in the middle of the room.

00:31:54.840 --> 00:31:59.840
And there's a lot of walls that like don't, that there are secret areas that you can bomb a hole through.

00:32:00.060 --> 00:32:04.120
Totally. So I think that's like your cue to say, hey, maybe try this out on these walls.

00:32:04.120 --> 00:32:07.000
