00:32:23.740 --> 00:32:31.060
And I will say that on the flip side of it, I think that there were some times where there's a bombing, a wall that's bombable or like a bush that's burnable.

00:32:31.800 --> 00:32:34.920
That they don't give you really any clues.

00:32:35.360 --> 00:32:36.300
Yeah. And I'm not sure.

00:32:36.480 --> 00:32:41.040
Like some of that I feel like is like, well, there's just a lot of guess and check and not necessarily like a lot of like figure it out yourself.

00:32:41.960 --> 00:32:45.200
But in some cases, I think there were like good leading hints.

00:32:45.780 --> 00:32:53.080
Yeah, I think an opposite opinion of the invisible hand thing is that it's really weird.

00:32:53.080 --> 00:32:59.160
I thought at least that when you get items in this game, no one, no one explains anything.

00:32:59.360 --> 00:33:03.320
