And you only get so many bombs.

00:39:17.900 --> 00:39:21.280
It's not like in Metroid where you have the little bombs infinitely.

00:39:21.460 --> 00:39:22.680
You can only just use one at a time.

00:39:22.740 --> 00:39:28.560
So I don't know. I guess I played the game pretty wrong, but I still enjoyed myself playing it.

00:39:28.560 --> 00:39:32.400
