But I think that there's something to be said about the fact that you didn't just be like, OK, well, I'm going to figure out the right way to do this.

00:39:48.580 --> 00:39:51.160
Like you kind of just said, like, this is the way I'm playing the game.

00:39:51.160 --> 00:39:53.340
So I'm just going to keep going as far as I possibly can.

00:39:53.340 --> 00:39:58.800
And that's something I wanted to talk about, actually, because I had a smaller version of that experience.

00:39:59.020 --> 00:40:00.180
