Still more Ganon, but he also talks and does a bunch of stupid garbage.

01:38:53.800 --> 01:38:57.080
Well, he looks sort of piggy human-y in this game.

01:38:57.080 --> 01:39:00.760
Yeah, no, I guess I just meant more like, you know, it's weird to hear him talking too.

