And by me saying the third quest, I realize we completely skipped over the second quest,

01:43:15.440 --> 01:43:18.940
but I think that we've skipped over that for good reason, because that is kind of like

01:43:18.940 --> 01:43:21.320
an entirely another way to play this game.

